{"id":"635205","name":"艾草凉粉","author":"甜甜mimi","authorId":"7708277","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/635205/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"艾草","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"白凉粉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"艾草是春天时摘的，储存冰箱里的，拿出来解冻。","img":"images/635205/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"解冻后放入破壁机中加入清水打成汁。","img":"images/635205/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"把渣过滤掉留汁。","img":"images/635205/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"白凉粉准备20g。","img":"images/635205/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"艾草汁倒入锅中煮沸，加入白凉粉。","img":"images/635205/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"煮沸关火。","img":"images/635205/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"倒入碗中放凉，再放入冰箱冷藏一小时左右。","img":"images/635205/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"拿出来切块。","img":"images/635205/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"QQ弹弹。","img":"images/635205/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入蜂蜜。","img":"images/635205/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"清凉解暑。","img":"images/635205/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：破壁机、煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}